OL,3,AUK net migration drops to lowest level
OL,4,Asince 1997 as number of people claiming
OL,5,Aasylum also falls
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Home Office figures show the
OL,8,Fnumber of people claiming asylum in the
OL,9,FUK dropped by a third in the year
OL,10,Fending September 2026 - but appeals are
OL,11,Fon the rise
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
