OL,4,Aconcerns over his shares in lobbying
OL,5,Afirm
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe has repeatedly let it be known he
OL,8,Fbelieves he has not acted criminally,
OL,9,Fdid not act for personal gain, and is
OL,10,Fco-operating with the police
