SC,0010
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1795697761
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK reservists contacted as 'threat
OL,4,Aenvironment' rises, Streeting says
OL,5,
OL,6,FStreeting told BBC Radio 4's Today
OL,7,Fprogramme that this meant should they
OL,8,Fever be needed "either for a national
OL,9,Fdisaster here at home or for a more
OL,10,Fserious threat or conflict elsewhere"
OL,11,Fthen they would "know where our
OL,12,Fstrategic reserve is" and what their
OL,13,Fskills were.
OL,15,F"I want the country to be alert, not
OL,16,Falarmed," he said.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
